              "text": "మన పరిసరాలను శుభ్రంగా ఉంచాలి. mana parisarālanu śubhraṅgā uñcāli. We should keep our surroundings clean."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Mostly plural. The area around a house, a school or a town."
            }
          ]
        },
